<title>SWEDEN: Nordbanken to buy S-E-Banken - daily.</title>
<headline>Nordbanken to buy S-E-Banken - daily.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Swedish financial daily reported on Monday that high street bank Nordbanken will buy its arch-rival S-E-Banken.</p>
<p>Finanstidningen said a Nordbanken purchase was being discussed by the two banks and an announcement could be made in coming weeks.</p>
<p>Speculation about a merger between the two banks has been intense for several weeks but a Nordbanken buy-out of its traditionally more powerful rival has not been mentioned before.</p>
<p>-- Simon Haydon, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1004</p>
